{"seq":2,"slug":"compression-and-cdn","title":"压缩与 CDN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/network-performance/compression-and-cdn","wordCount":762,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"压缩与-cdn\">压缩与 CDN</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>传输层的两项基础优化是压缩与 CDN。压缩减少&quot;每个字节要传多久&quot;：文本类资源（HTML/CSS/JS/JSON/SVG）用 Brotli 通常比 Gzip 再多省 15-20%，且对静态资源可在构建时预压缩以省去运行时开销，但注意不要重复压缩已压缩的图片/视频。CDN 减少&quot;字节要传多远&quot;：把资源缓存到离用户最近的边缘节点，降低 TTFB，并配合缓存策略与版本化 URL 管理失效。协议层面，HTTP/2 的多路复用消除了 HTTP/1.1 的队头阻塞与域名分片需求，HTTP/3 基于 QUIC 进一步改善弱网与连接建立，这些都会改变传统优化手段的收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"传输压缩\">传输压缩</h2><p>文本类资源（HTML、CSS、JavaScript、JSON、SVG）具有极高的压缩率。通过 Gzip 或 Brotli 压缩，可以将传输体积减少 60-80%，显著加速资源下载。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;原始文件 (100KB)&quot;] --&gt; B{压缩算法}&#10;    B --&gt;|Gzip| C[&quot;~30KB (-70%)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|Brotli| D[&quot;~25KB (-75%)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|无压缩| E[&quot;100KB&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"原始文件 (100KB)\"] --&gt; B{压缩算法}\n    B --&gt;|Gzip| C[\"~30KB (-70%)\"]\n    B --&gt;|Brotli| D[\"~25KB (-75%)\"]\n    B --&gt;|无压缩| E[\"100KB\"]</pre><h3 id=\"gzip-vs-brotli\">Gzip vs Brotli</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Gzip</th>\n<th>Brotli</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>压缩率</td>\n<td>好（~70%）</td>\n<td>更好（~75-80%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解压速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器支持</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>97%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>动态压缩</td>\n<td>静态预压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 标识</td>\n<td>gzip</td>\n<td>br</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"压缩协商流程\">压缩协商流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant B as 浏览器&#10;    participant S as 服务器&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /app.js&lt;br&gt;Accept-Encoding: gzip, deflate, br&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 选择最优压缩算法&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK&lt;br&gt;Content-Encoding: br&lt;br&gt;Vary: Accept-Encoding&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: 解压 Brotli&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: 执行 JavaScript\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant B as 浏览器\n    participant S as 服务器\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: GET /app.js&lt;br&gt;Accept-Encoding: gzip, deflate, br\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 选择最优压缩算法\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: 200 OK&lt;br&gt;Content-Encoding: br&lt;br&gt;Vary: Accept-Encoding\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: 解压 Brotli\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: 执行 JavaScript</pre><h3 id=\"nginx-压缩配置\">Nginx 压缩配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nginx\" data-code=\"gzip on;&#10;gzip_vary on;&#10;gzip_proxied any;&#10;gzip_comp_level 6;&#10;gzip_min_length 1024;&#10;gzip_types&#10;    text/plain&#10;    text/css&#10;    text/javascript&#10;    application/javascript&#10;    application/json&#10;    application/xml&#10;    image/svg+xml&#10;    font/woff2;&#10;&#10;brotli on;&#10;brotli_comp_level 6;&#10;brotli_static on;&#10;brotli_types&#10;    text/plain&#10;    text/css&#10;    text/javascript&#10;    application/javascript&#10;    application/json&#10;    application/xml&#10;    image/svg+xml;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>gzip on;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gzip_vary on;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gzip_proxied any;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gzip_comp_level 6;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gzip_min_length 1024;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gzip_types</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text/plain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text/css</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text/javascript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    application/javascript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    application/xml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    image/svg+xml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    font/woff2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>brotli on;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>brotli_comp_level 6;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>brotli_static on;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>brotli_types</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text/plain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text/css</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text/javascript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    application/javascript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    application/xml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    image/svg+xml;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"构建时预压缩\">构建时预压缩</h3><p>在构建阶段预先生成压缩文件，避免服务器实时压缩的 CPU 开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { gzip, brotliCompress } from &#39;zlib&#39;;&#10;import { promisify } from &#39;util&#39;;&#10;import { readFile, writeFile } from &#39;fs/promises&#39;;&#10;import { glob } from &#39;glob&#39;;&#10;&#10;const gzipAsync = promisify(gzip);&#10;const brotliAsync = promisify(brotliCompress);&#10;&#10;async function preCompress(pattern: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const files = await glob(pattern);&#10;  let totalOriginal = 0;&#10;  let totalGzip = 0;&#10;  let totalBrotli = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (const file of files) {&#10;    const content = await readFile(file);&#10;    totalOriginal += content.length;&#10;&#10;    const gzipped = await gzipAsync(content, { level: 9 });&#10;    await writeFile(`${file}.gz`, gzipped);&#10;    totalGzip += gzipped.length;&#10;&#10;    const brotlied = await brotliAsync(content);&#10;    await writeFile(`${file}.br`, brotlied);&#10;    totalBrotli += brotlied.length;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  console.log(`Original: ${(totalOriginal / 1024).toFixed(1)} KB`);&#10;  console.log(&#10;    `Gzip:     ${(totalGzip / 1024).toFixed(1)} KB (${((1 - totalGzip / totalOriginal) * 100).toFixed(1)}% saved)`,&#10;  );&#10;  console.log(&#10;    `Brotli:   ${(totalBrotli / 1024).toFixed(1)} KB (${((1 - totalBrotli / totalOriginal) * 100).toFixed(1)}% saved)`,&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;preCompress(&#39;dist/**/*.{js,css,html,json,svg}&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { gzip, brotliCompress } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zlib'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { promisify } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'util'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { readFile, writeFile } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fs/promises'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { glob } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'glob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">c